---
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand-col">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <span class="brand-publisher">Publisher</span>
        <span class="brand-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span class="brand-word">Word</span>
      </div>
      <p class="footer-desc">
        A calm, step-by-step visual guide designed specifically for former Microsoft Publisher users adapting to Microsoft Word.
      </p>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary print-btn" onclick="window.print()">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5 2.75C5 2.06 5.56 1.5 6.25 1.5h7.5c.69 0 1.25.56 1.25 1.25v2.5H5v-2.5zm-1.5 4h13A2.25 2.25 0 0118.75 9v5A2.25 2.25 0 0116.5 16.25h-1.5V17c0 .69-.56 1.25-1.25 1.25H6.25A1.25 1.25 0 015 17v-.75H3.5A2.25 2.25 0 011.25 14V9A2.25 2.25 0 013.5 6.75zm3 6h7a.75.75 0 00.75-.75V10.5a.75.75 0 00-.75-.75h-7a.75.75 0 00-.75.75v1.5c0 .414.336.75.75.75z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
        </svg>
        <span>Print this Page</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-links-col">
      <h2 class="footer-heading">Learning Guide</h2>
      <ul class="footer-links">
        <li><a href="/start-here">Start Here (Orientation)</a></li>
        <li><a href="/lessons">All 14 Lessons</a></li>
        <li><a href="/lessons/01-how-text-flows">Lesson 1: How Text Flows</a></li>
        <li><a href="/projects">Hands-On Projects</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-links-col">
      <h2 class="footer-heading">Quick Help</h2>
      <ul class="footer-links">
        <li><a href="/translator">Publisher → Word Translator</a></li>
        <li><a href="/rescue">"Why Did That Happen?" Rescue Guide</a></li>
        <li><a href="/cheat-sheet">Printable Cheat Sheets</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <p>
      Microsoft, Word, and Publisher are trademarks of Microsoft Corporation. This website is an independent educational resource and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Microsoft.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    background-color: var(--surface-card);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    margin-block-start: auto;
    padding-block-start: var(--space-10);
    padding-block-end: var(--space-6);
  }

  .footer-inner {
    max-width: 72rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: var(--space-4);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .footer-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-6);
    }
  }

  .footer-brand {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-block-end: var(--space-2);
  }

  .brand-publisher {
    color: var(--accent-publisher);
  }

  .brand-arrow {
    color: var(--ink-secondary);
  }

  .brand-word {
    color: var(--accent-word);
  }

  .footer-desc {
    color: var(--ink-secondary);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    max-inline-size: 45ch;
    margin-block-end: var(--space-4);
  }

  .print-btn {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
  }

  .footer-heading {
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-block-start: 0;
    margin-block-end: var(--space-3);
  }

  .footer-links {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .footer-links li {
    margin-block-end: var(--space-2);
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: var(--ink-secondary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-word);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    max-width: 72rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: var(--space-4);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-8);
    padding-block-start: var(--space-4);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .footer-bottom p {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
